5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I believe we should start by understanding the human element. I will look into the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see where the money actually goes! I'll check the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think it would be wise to see what actually happened before. I will look into the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm not letting this be a guessing game. I'll check the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the station records from partner field sites.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"To ensure the infrastructure can support the research, I will examine the national computing agreement and facility day rates, as well as the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Those are all very sensible choices. It seems we have covered the human, financial, historical, physical, and digital aspects of our infrastructure quite thoroughly.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, you're so fancy with your words! I just want to make sure we aren't missing any hidden surprises in the budget. Does anyone else think we should check the day rates too?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I think Minako has that covered... but maybe it's a good idea to be sure. I'm just worried we might overlook something important if we don't.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,We've already split the list up. Let's just stick to our choices for now and see what we find. No point in doubling up if we can cover more ground.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Takumi. We have a comprehensive plan, and duplicating efforts now would be inefficient. Let us proceed with our selected investigations.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, efficiency is a virtue. I shall remain curious to see how our individual findings weave together to form a complete picture of our current capabilities.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm already excited! I bet I'll find something super interesting in those ledgers. I hope the money is actually going where it's supposed to!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I just hope the past results give us a clear direction... it's always so stressful when the outcome is uncertain.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"Stop worrying, Daisuke. We're doing the legwork now so we don't have to guess later. Let's just get the data and get it over with.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I concur. Let us move forward and gather the facts. I am ready to begin my review of the computing agreements and facility bookings.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Then it is settled. May our findings bring us the clarity we need to make a decision that serves both the science and the scientists.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! Let's go find some secrets! I'll be the fastest one to finish, just you wait and see!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll try my best to be thorough... I don't want to miss anything that might be important for the others.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Enough talking. Let's just get to the records and see what's actually happening on the ground.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let us conclude this round and proceed to the investigation phase.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
